From 184a37594f88f1ffbacb01ceb2b6ff916aeef75f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amir Latipov <kimciwork@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:01:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(ai-lab): tech building counters and AI_LAB_TRACE
 diagnostics

- AIMatch result schema 2: derricks/tech buildings on map at start and
  per player at 5 min, 10 min and match end.
- AI_LAB_TRACE=<substring>: read-only stderr trace of tech building
  owners, capture upgrade, team units (AI state, goal), script condition
  transitions, sequential scripts, team builds, tech-within-distance,
  move-towards-nearest target and capture hunt candidates.
  Does not change CRC.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
